h  now if you haven't got any money at all  to start with  i would package deals and i would sell  them to investors  find properties that are below market  value or  find properties that could be potential  development opportunities  potential bar refurbished opportunities  get the skills  view them find them investors right now  are going crazy for good deals  if you can find a good deal you can sell  it on you can make two thousand pounds  so i'll be doing deal selling alongside  rent to rents  i'd be going crazy i'd be like look it's  by june 21st  i haven't got four rent to rents  making me 2 000 pounds minimum and if  i'm not able to package and sell a deal  making me 2 000 pounds minimum then i  die that's how i would act  and then by june 21st 2021 you're gonna  be you're gonna be packaging and selling  one deal a month  you're gonna have a few rental rents  giving you two thousand pound a month  are you gonna be rich no are you gonna  have to be able to line the beach  forever no  but are you gonna have to go and work at  a job come june 21st no  you're going to be full-time in property  and that is what i would do to become  financially free  and then geez but by the time that  happens then you can set a new plan  then you can say right now my plan is i  want to stop building my own portfolio i  want to start  joint venturing on deals i want to turn  some of my rental rents  into lease option agreements we have the  right to buy them you can worry about  that  in the summer but right now just find  the the strength right now and the  motivation  to do whatever it takes to get yourself  in a position  by june 21st where you do not have to go  and get a job  anyway i hope you found it helpful um  smash the like  button subscribe and i'm going to be  doing videos every single day on youtube  giving you content helping you so that  you can do this you know working with  you along the way  if you want to join me at the property  investors crash course it's a fr